specifications:
  - "The matrix documents a ready-to-work Kalkomey machine: cross-platform rows; macOS-only rows carry Ubuntu=n/a (iOS); legacy/single-platform stacks are recorded out-of-scope, not omitted"
  - "JDK target is 17+ (Gradle 8.x floor); PHP target is 8.2 (eRegulations); .NET SDK is opt-in/niche (modern cross-platform tools only)"
